&P508772 = Foxvog 001 
#atf: lang sux 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. 1(u) 4(disz) 1/3(disz) gin2 e2# [du3]-a# 
#tr.en: 14 1/3 shekel-measures of built house, 
2. e2 ARAD-{d}suen [dumu ku-nu]-um#-ki-tusz-bi-a 
#tr.en: a house of Warad-Sîn son of Kunum-kitušbia, 
3. da e2 i-din-er3-ra# 
#tr.en: next to the house of Iddin-Erra, 
4. sa10 til-la-bi-sze3# 
#tr.en: for its full selling-price 
5. [n] gin2 igi 6(disz)-gal2 ku3-babbar 
#tr.en: n and 1/6 shekels of silver 
6. in#-na-an-la2# 
#tr.en: he weighed out to him, (and so) 
7. ki ARAD-{d}suen dumu# ku-nu-um#-ki-tusz-bi-a-ta 
#tr.en: from Warad-Sîn son of Kunum-kitušbia 
8. {disz}i-din-er3-ra x 
#tr.en: Iddin-Erra 
9. in-szi-in#-sa10# 
#tr.en: bought it from him. 
10. [u4]-kur2-sze3# {disz#}ARAD-{d}suen 
#tr.en: In future, Warad-Sîn 
11. u3# dumu ibila#-a#?-ni a-na-me-a-bi 
#tr.en: and his sons and heirs, whoever they may be, 
# cp. OSP 1, 47 (P216104) passim 
12. e2#-sze3 inim# nu-um#-ga2-ga2-a 
#tr.en: that they will not raise any claim for the house 
13. mu# lugal#-bi# in#-[pa3] 
#tr.en: so they swore by the name of the king. 
$ (glued-on middle fragment of lines 11-13 is incorrectly placed) 
@reverse 
1. gesz-zal#-szu#?-du7# dumu# {d}utu-he2-gal2# 
#tr.en: Gešzal-šudu the son of Utu-hegal, 
2. {disz}{d}bara2#?-{d}utu dumu# ARAD-{d}utu 
#tr.en: Bara-Utu the son of Warad-Šamaš, 
3. {disz}ri?-ti-dingir dumu nu-ur2-a-nim 
#tr.en: Ritti-ilim the son of Nūr-Anim, 
4. {disz}lum?-ma#?-sze-mi dumu szu?-[x x?]-x-a# 
#tr.en: Lumma-šemi the son of Šu-[...]-a. 
$ blank space 
# potential modern repair, loss of seal impression 
5. [iti] NE#-NE#-gar 
#tr.en: Month NE-NE-gar. 
# some text moved to next line 
6. mu-us2-sa {d}da-mi-iq-i3-li2-szu lugal e2-di-ku5-kalam-ma {d}utu-ra mu-na-du3 
#tr.en: Year after Damiq-Ilišu the king built for Utu the temple (named) Judge of the Nation. 
